Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.42,0:00:06.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家好  感恩节快乐  嘘嘘\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, everybody. Happy Thanksgiving. Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:10.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不让大家知道  今年有感恩节吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What, are we keeping Thanksgiving a secret this year?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.55,0:00:12.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是  我们正在玩一个游戏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, we're playing this game I learned at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.55,0:00:15.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要在六分钟内  写出美国各州州名\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You have to name all the states in six minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.34,0:00:17.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个啊   太容易了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? That's, like, insanely easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.14,0:00:20.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上这个游戏很难   你总是会漏掉一个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, it's harder than it sounds. You always forget at least one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.98,0:00:24.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,某些人会漏掉  十四个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Or in some cases, 14.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.35,0:00:27.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这太蠢了  我没有跟任何人玩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's a stupid game and I wasn't playing against other people...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.11,0:00:29.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以技术上来说我没输\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...so technically, I didn't lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.15,0:00:32.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你忘了十四州的州名\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You forgot 14 states?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.32,0:00:34.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有人在乎南北达科他州\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nobody cares about the Dakotas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.07,0:00:37.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  时间到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, okay, time's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.70,0:00:39.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  我写出四十八州\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, I got 48.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.29,0:00:40.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还不错  菲比呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, that's not bad. Pheebs?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.00,0:00:45.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我厌倦写州名   所以决定写出各种芹菜的名字\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I got tired of naming states, so I decided to list the types of celery.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.13,0:00:49.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我写了一个  普通芹菜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I have one, regular celery.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.34,0:00:54.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好   瑞秋写出四十八州   菲比在蔬菜名称方面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, so Rachel's got 48 and Phoebe has the lead in...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.59,0:00:57.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,称霸  乔伊呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...vegetables. Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.76,0:01:00.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟钱德的愚蠢州名游戏新冠军打声招呼吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Say hello to the new champ of Chandler's dumb states game.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.77,0:01:05.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇   你写了几个   五十六个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, how many you got? Fifty-six.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.52,0:01:11.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老友记  第七季  第8集  钱德不爱狗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Friends S07E08  The One Where Chandler Doesn't Like Dogs
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.65,0:01:15.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 珍妮佛·安妮斯顿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.95,0:01:19.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 寇妮·考克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.24,0:01:22.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 丽莎·库卓
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.91,0:01:29.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 麦特·勒布兰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.29,0:01:32.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 马修·派瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.75,0:01:35.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 大卫·修蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.19,0:01:48.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,新英格兰为什么不是一个州\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, how is New England not a state?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.69,0:01:50.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们有运动代表队\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Huh? They have a sports team.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.73,0:01:53.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,南奥勒冈有运动代表队吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Does South Oregon have a sports team?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.32,0:01:57.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.78,0:02:01.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么多了一付餐具\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How come we have one extra place setting?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.08,0:02:06.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你邀了你的助理过来  对了  抱歉  秦格不来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because you invited your assistant. Oh, right, sorry. Tag's not coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.66,0:02:09.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他女朋友来了  所以他得去陪她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}His girlfriend came into town, so he's spending Thanksgiving with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.71,0:02:10.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么没有告诉我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, why didn't you tell me'?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.96,0:02:14.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我帮他做了专属的  番薯酿南瓜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I made him his own individual sweet potato stuffed pumpkin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.71,0:02:17.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我本来想说   但我想\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, well, I was going to, but then I figured, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.76,0:02:21.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你做的菜既好吃  又好看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...your food is so delicious and perfect...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.26,0:02:24.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想多吃一点你做的南瓜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...you can never have too many of those pumpkin things.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.27,0:02:29.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你这话太假了  你以为我会相信  不过我还是觉得听着很高兴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You'd think I wouldn't enjoy that because it is so fake, ha, ha, but I still do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.69,0:02:32.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,普通芹菜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Regular celery.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.07,0:02:34.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经写了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I already have that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.53,0:02:40.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  时间还剩下很多\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Done, with time to spare.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.03,0:02:45.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这可能是新世界记录   我讨厌对你们说教\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ooh, this may be a new world's record. You know, I hate to lecture you guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.95,0:02:49.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但这真的是太丢脸了  一群受过良好教育的成年人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but it's kind of disgraceful that a group of well-educated adults...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.83,0:02:54.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟乔伊  无法写出全部的州名\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and Joey, can't name all the states.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.71,0:03:00.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们看过地图  或是圆圆的色彩鲜艳叫做"地球仪"的东西吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You ever see a map or one of those round colorful things called a globe?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.47,0:03:04.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦哲伦先生  你只答对了四十六州\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, Magellan? You got 46 states.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.56,0:03:08.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么   不可能   四十六州\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? That's impossible. Forty-six.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.48,0:03:11.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个受过良好教育  写不出剩下十州州名的人是谁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, who's well-educated now, Mr. I-Forgot-Ten-States?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.94,0:03:15.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,烤箱太满了  我要借乔伊的烤箱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm out of oven space. I'm gonna go turn on Joey's.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.15,0:03:19.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托   看好他   别让乔伊偷吃东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Please, watch him. Do not let Joey eat any of the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.36,0:03:21.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只有一个人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I am only one man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.20,0:03:25.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了   时间到   再给我1分钟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, time is up. Give me another minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.04,0:03:29.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果现在想不出来   你永远都想不出来   好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, if you don't know them by now, you will never know them, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.41,0:03:33.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就是这个游戏好玩的地方   它会让你想要杀了自己\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That is the beauty of this game. It makes you want to kill yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.88,0:03:35.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太疯狂了   我一定答得出来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is crazy. I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.21,0:03:39.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧   我敢说我能在晚饭前写出五十个州的州名\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, uh, I bet I can get all 50, uh, before dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.84,0:03:42.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧   但你写不出来就不能吃晚饭\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, but if you can't, no dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.30,0:03:43.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就这么说定了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.93,0:03:47.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别偷看我的答案   里面有很多你写不出来的州名\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, don't look at my list, because there's a lot on there that you don't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.39,0:03:52.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道你的烤箱坏了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, did you guys know your oven doesn't work?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.60,0:03:55.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可装满外送菜单的抽屉   没坏吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But the drawer full of takeout menus is okay, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.65,0:03:59.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯   我要借用你的烤箱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, I'm gonna use yours, okay? Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.36,0:04:01.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德   快来帮我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler, give me a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.86,0:04:07.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊   别让罗斯偷看地图或你家的地球仪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sure. Joey, do not let Ross look at any maps or the globe in your apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.28,0:04:10.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别担心   那又不是美国的地球仪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't worry, Chandler. It's not a globe of the United States.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.96,0:04:20.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿   我要去散个步\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, you guys, I'm gonna go out and take a walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.84,0:04:23.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  你的包包为什么在动\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, why is your bag moving?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.30,0:04:25.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有啊   它真的在动\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, it's not. Seriously, it's moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.10,0:04:29.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,里面装了什么东西   就是我编织的东西而已\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What the hell's in there?  It's just my knitting. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.35,0:04:37.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对   我织了这个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, I knit this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.02,0:04:40.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很厉害\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.41,0:04:48.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯的公寓很漂亮  为什么我们从不来这里混\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross' apartment is nice. Why don't we hang out here more often?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.70,0:04:50.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道   或许是因为它有个怪味道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know. Maybe because it smells weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.70,0:04:52.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有点像是放了很久的南瓜味\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's like old pumpkins or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.41,0:04:56.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我的派   这个味道好香\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's my pie. Which smells delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.04,0:04:58.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇啊哦  怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh-oh. Uh-oh. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.17,0:05:01.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们让乔伊跟食物独处了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We left Joey alone with the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.17,0:05:03.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错   我就知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yep, yep, I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.84,0:05:05.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There he is...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.63,0:05:08.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拿馅料喂小狗吃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...feeding stuffing to a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.48,0:05:17.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好  这里是盖勒及宾的家  有什么事吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, Geller-Bing residence. How can I help?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.06,0:05:20.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比   为什么我们家会有狗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, why is there a dog in our apartment?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.32,0:05:22.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起   你是谁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry, who's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.61,0:05:25.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  有只狗坐在我的沙发上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, there's a dog sitting on my couch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.53,0:05:28.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉她我对狗过敏   我会告诉她的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Tell her I'm allergic, and I will sue.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.16,0:05:33.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里没有狗  不  真的有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, there's no dog here. Yes There is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.45,0:05:35.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是黑白相间   而且毛很长\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He's black and white and shaggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.79,0:05:38.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他就坐在瑞秋旁边  正在舔她的手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He's sitting next to Rachel and licking Rachel's hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.38,0:05:40.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊   你在哪里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.80,0:05:44.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我马上回去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll be right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.72,0:05:48.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们已经回来了  怎么这么快啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They're here already? How are they doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.35,0:05:56.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  泰格  你来这里做什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, Tag. What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.81,0:06:00.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想知道你的邀请   是不是还有效\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I, uh, wanted to see if your offer to spend Thanksgiving with you was still good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.23,0:06:02.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然有效   快进来吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, sure. Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.03,0:06:05.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你女朋友呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, what happened to your girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.36,0:06:07.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天早上我们分手了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We, uh, kind of broke up this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.78,0:06:11.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很遗憾   所以她回俄亥俄去了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I'm sorry. Yeah, so she went back to Ohio.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.41,0:06:14.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,俄亥俄州  谢谢你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ohio, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.79,0:06:20.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,狗在哪里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Huh. Where's the dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.42,0:06:22.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么狗  这里没有狗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What dog? There's no dog here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.84,0:06:24.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那只狗离开了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, that dog left.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.09,0:06:28.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.63,0:06:30.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比   快开门\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, open up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.55,0:06:31.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,房间里没有狗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There's no dog in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.31,0:06:36.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比   我们听到了狗叫声了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, we can hear the dog barking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.77,0:06:38.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不   那只是我的咳嗽声\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, that's just me coughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.36,0:06:45.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好  你们回来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, good. There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.15,0:06:49.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我房间里有只狗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Listen, urn, I have a dog in my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.86,0:06:51.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在这里做什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What is it doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.49,0:06:53.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我帮我朋友照顾他   他们有事出城去了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm watching it for friends who went out of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.08,0:06:55.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.66,0:06:59.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  我是克朗克\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello, my name is Klunkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.21,0:07:02.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以跟你们这些大好人住在一起吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}May I please stay with you nice people?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.54,0:07:07.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也希望能留他住下来   但钱德对狗过敏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I wish he could stay here, but Chandler's allergic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.34,0:07:09.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我对狗严重过敏   好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Extremely allergic, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.38,0:07:12.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要我一靠近狗   超过五分钟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If I am anywhere near a dog for more than five minutes...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.80,0:07:15.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的喉咙就会紧缩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...my throat will just close up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.60,0:07:19.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是奇怪   这只狗在这里住了三天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's odd, because this dog's been living here for the past three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.23,0:07:26.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.07,0:07:29.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果他在这里住了那么久\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If the dog has been here that long...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.74,0:07:32.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你一点反应都没有   或许你对他不会过敏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and you haven't had a reaction, maybe you're not allergic to this dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.74,0:07:34.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他还是得离开   好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, it still has to go, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.16,0:07:36.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.41,0:07:40.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧   我   别那么做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, it's, um-Don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.37,0:07:44.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别做什么   我非说不可\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't do what? I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.50,0:07:46.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吗   时间到了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay? It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.30,0:07:52.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧   我讨厌狗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I hate dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.80,0:07:54.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么   太疯狂了  为什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? That's crazy. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.43,0:07:57.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我早跟你说过了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.69,0:08:04.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们很黏人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They are needy...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.27,0:08:07.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爱乱跳   你不知道他们在想什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...they are jumpy, and you can't tell what they are thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.44,0:08:09.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那样子把我吓得半死\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and that scares me a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.44,0:08:13.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说的对  他们很可怕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're right. They are scary. Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.41,0:08:16.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他吃掉了放在我手上的点心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She just ate a treat out of my hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.45,0:08:22.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下  你不喜欢所有的狗   连小狗都不喜欢吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait a minute. Do you not like all dogs? I mean, not even puppies?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.29,0:08:23.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里有小狗吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is there a puppy here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.46,0:08:28.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不喜欢小狗  喂  你是新来的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You don't like puppies? Okay, you are new.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.34,0:08:36.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着   钱德   我跟你说过  别跟其他人说你不喜欢狗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, Chandler, I told you. Never tell anyone about this dog thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.93,0:08:38.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就像罗斯不喜欢冰淇淋一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's like Ross not liking ice cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.64,0:08:43.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不喜欢冰淇淋   它太冰了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You don't like ice cream? It's too cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.85,0:08:47.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,狗也让我觉得很不舒服\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, it's just that dogs make me a little uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.07,0:08:49.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的牙齿冰得好痛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hurts my teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.61,0:08:52.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想这么说   不希望你们讨厌我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't wanna say this. I don't want you guys to hate me...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.11,0:08:56.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我不喜欢这只狗  待在我身边  好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but, uh, I don't think I can be around that dog anymore, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.82,0:09:00.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是那只狗走   就是我走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So either the dog goes or I go. Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.83,0:09:08.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.09,0:09:14.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么可能答不出来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How can I not get this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.01,0:09:18.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是大学教授  SAT了考了1450分\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm a college professor. I got 1450 on my SATs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.85,0:09:20.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是1250分才对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Twelve fifty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.35,0:09:23.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该死   我忘了你在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Damn, I forgot you were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.14,0:09:26.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我们得把克朗克送到罗斯家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. We're gonna take Klunkers to Ross'.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.52,0:09:27.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,马上就回来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We'll be back in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.94,0:09:29.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下  你们离开前  我能问你们一个问题吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, wait, before you go, can I ask a question?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.48,0:09:32.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果一个男人跟女朋友分手了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, when a guy breaks up with his girlfriend...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.03,0:09:37.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得等多久才能采取行动\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...what is an appropriate amount of time to wait before you make a move?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.32,0:09:38.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想是一个月\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I'd say about a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.24,0:09:42.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗   我觉得是三到四个月  半小时\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? I'd say three to four. Half-hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.71,0:09:48.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真有趣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.88,0:09:50.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他是你的助理   我劝你别那么做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When it's your assistant, I would say never.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.04,0:09:54.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了   瑞秋  问题是他喜欢你吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, Rach, the big question is, does he like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.84,0:09:58.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果他不喜欢你   这样做只是在对牛放屁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right? Because if he doesn't like you, this is all a moo point.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.05,0:10:03.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对牛 "放屁"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Huh. A "moo" point?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.23,0:10:08.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  牛不知道你做了什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. It's like a cow's opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.19,0:10:11.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那不重要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It just doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.32,0:10:15.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是在 "放屁"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's "moo."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.24,0:10:25.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我跟他同居太久   还是他的话真的有道理\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Have I been living with him for too long, or did that all just make sense?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.83,0:10:29.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别听乔伊的   好吗   看看他的样子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Please don't listen to Joey. Okay? Would you look at him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.17,0:10:32.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他很沮丧   家人又不在身边\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He's obviously depressed. He's away from his family.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.17,0:10:34.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在跟陌生人过感恩节\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He's spending Thanksgiving with strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.96,0:10:37.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在他需要你这个朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What he needs right now is for you to be his friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.30,0:10:39.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说的对  对不起  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, you're right. I'm sorry. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.09,0:10:44.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我会那么做的  很好  照她们的话去做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, that's what I'm going to do. Fine, take their advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.31,0:10:45.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,反正没有人会听我的话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No one ever listens to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.02,0:10:49.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要包装好看  没有人会在乎内容\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When the package is this pretty, no one cares what's inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.57,0:10:57.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.90,0:10:59.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How you holding up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.91,0:11:01.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还可以  是吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not bad. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.62,0:11:04.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,关于你女朋友的事我很遗憾   谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry about your girlfriend. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.16,0:11:09.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们在一起很久了吗   一年了  总是分分合合的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Were you guys together a long time? A year, on and off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.67,0:11:13.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为我们会相守一生   现在我不会那么想了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I thought we'd end up together. I don't anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.25,0:11:15.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为她跟你分手了   对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now that she broke up with you. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.96,0:11:18.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这真的很奇怪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hmm. It's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.88,0:11:23.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以前总以为我会遇见一个人  坠入爱河  过着幸福的生活\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I always used to assume that I would meet someone and fall in love and be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.51,0:11:27.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好像很自然而然  最近我会想如果不是那样呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That all that was just a given. Well, lately, it's like, what if it's not?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.27,0:11:30.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有那种感觉吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you ever have that feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.31,0:11:31.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.31,0:11:33.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.36,0:11:36.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我常有那种感觉  一直都有  真的很可怕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All the time. Constantly. It's terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.07,0:11:40.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但后来我想通了  一定会发生的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But, you know, then I figure it has to work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.24,0:11:42.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.07,0:11:45.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为一定会的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because it has to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.08,0:11:49.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的什么都知道  对吧  没错  我真的什么都知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You have all the answers, don't you? Yeah, I know, I do. I really do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.16,0:11:54.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你陪我聊  别这样  这不是上司的工作吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, thanks for talking to me. Come on, what are bosses for?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.04,0:11:56.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快来抱一下吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hug it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.51,0:12:00.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  他也喜欢你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, he likes you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.43,0:12:05.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说过你该表白的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Huh? Told you you should go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.43,0:12:07.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.52,0:12:13.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下面的噪音有没有盖过那句话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Street noise drown any of that out?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.02,0:12:17.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有吗  待会见  好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No? All right, I'll see you later. Ha, ha. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.03,0:12:24.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚乔伊说了什么   我也喜欢你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What did Joey say? I like you back?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.99,0:12:27.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道的   他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, yeah-You know, well, see, he...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.74,0:12:33.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊知道  我对我的背没信心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey knows that I'm very insecure about my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.96,0:12:37.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚你在抱我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And... And you were hugging me...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.46,0:12:41.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很明显地   你不讨厌它   没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...so obviously you are not repulsed by it. Yeah. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.38,0:12:45.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下   那样根本说不通\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait a minute, that doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.30,0:12:46.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.56,0:12:52.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧   事实是这样的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, here's the truth. Ahem.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.73,0:12:55.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊会那么说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey said what he said because, urn...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.61,0:12:59.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我被你吸引\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I'm attracted to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.78,0:13:03.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对   我承认\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow. Yeah, I admit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.86,0:13:08.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我暗恋你  我知道那很疯狂  因为我们是同事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I have a crush on you. And, uh, I know that's crazy because we work together...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.16,0:13:10.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们之间不该发生任何事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and nothing could ever happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.04,0:13:13.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一点都不想吓到你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And the last thing I wanted to do was freak you out...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.71,0:13:16.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或是让你觉得不自在\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...or make you feel uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.92,0:13:21.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我认为  你最好快说句话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Which is why it would be really great if you said something right about now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.34,0:13:25.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊   那些家伙在偷我的车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. Those guys are stealing my car.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.43,0:13:28.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么   就在那边   那是我的车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Right there. That's my car.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.64,0:13:31.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿   好了  他们得花点时间\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey! Okay, that's gonna take a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.81,0:13:34.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有话要跟我说吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you have anything else you wanna get off your chest?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.60,0:13:35.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不敢相信\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.14,0:13:39.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们还有时间谈   他们还没上车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait, we still have time to talk, and they're not even in the car yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.15,0:13:42.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看  他们上车了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, look, there they go. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.65,0:13:46.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  菲比   或许我们该回去了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, Phoebe. We should probably go back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.95,0:13:49.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,求求你   别离开我   我会很寂寞的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Please, don't leave me. I'll be lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.37,0:13:52.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,停了  别说了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Stop it. Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.74,0:13:56.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们走吧   我们可以很坚强的   好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, let's go. We can be strong. Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.79,0:14:02.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊   你听到了吗    他在叫 "摩妮卡"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God, did you hear that? She said "Monica."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.42,0:14:06.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能丢下他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I can't leave her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.26,0:14:09.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以偷偷把狗带回去  钱德不会发现的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If you want, we could sneak the dog back in and Chandler wouldn't even know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.51,0:14:10.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那样怕是不行的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's not gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.76,0:14:13.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我把小狗藏在房间里三天了   钱德完全不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I had that dog there for three days and Chandler had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.22,0:14:15.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他没有那么聪明\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He's not so smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.81,0:14:18.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  我也不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. I didn't know either.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.60,0:14:22.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  但是你觉得怪怪的  对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, but you kind of knew that something was going on, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.44,0:14:24.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错   我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I knew. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.03,0:14:32.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德在哪里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Where's Chandler?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.41,0:14:35.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在这里   快去洗手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here I am. Wash your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.33,0:14:39.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.05,0:14:46.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他怎么又回来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, what's she doing back here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.30,0:14:49.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别激动   罗斯   他不是冰淇淋做的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Relax, Ross. She's not made of ice cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.68,0:14:54.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  菲比  我按照位置将各州州名排好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, look, Phoebe. I, uh, laid out the states geographically.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.43,0:14:55.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没时间谈这事了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no, we don't have time for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.02,0:14:57.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能让钱德靠近我房间\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We have to keep Chandler away from my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.98,0:14:59.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对   但是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, but, look what I--
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.31,0:15:01.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们没有时间了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See, this is exactly what we do not have time for.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.61,0:15:09.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡在哪里  她在菲比房里  你不能进去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Where's Monica? Uh, in Phoebe's room. You can't go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.16,0:15:11.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.99,0:15:15.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡在哭\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica's crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.37,0:15:21.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,关于克朗克的事   她非常难过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She's very upset about this whole Klunkers thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.37,0:15:24.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我应该进去的  不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I should go in there. No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.67,0:15:28.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不   现在她不想见你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, she doesn't want to see you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.55,0:15:32.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么   因为你把那只狗赶走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why not? Because you sent away the dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.26,0:15:35.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太可笑了  是吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's ridiculous. Oh, is it? Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.72,0:15:42.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着   小时候摩妮卡跟我养了一只狗叫路佛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, when Monica and I were kids, we had a dog named Rover.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.94,0:15:46.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有一天  我爸决定不再喜欢狗了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And, um, one day, my dad decides he doesn't like dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.98,0:15:50.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡跟她的朋友菲丽丝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So Monica and her friend...Phyllis...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.16,0:15:55.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把狗送走  那是我们最后一次见到他  好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...take away the dog, and that was the last time we ever saw him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.45,0:15:58.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你懂吗  这次也一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't you see? This is just like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.12,0:16:03.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只不过有些细节不一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...only with a few details changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.42,0:16:08.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧   我换了运动裤\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I'm in my sweatpants.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.84,0:16:10.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把食物端上来吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Bring on the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.93,0:16:16.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了   摩妮卡因为\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's the matter? Monica's all upset...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.30,0:16:18.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,克朗克的事很难过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...because I sent Klunkers away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.85,0:16:21.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以呢  就把狗抱回来了  你会成为大英雄的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So? Bring the dog back. You're a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.98,0:16:25.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  我可以当大英雄  我可以那么做  可以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I could be a hero. I could do that. I could. I could do...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.31,0:16:27.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,万一他攻击我呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What if it--? What if it attacks me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.48,0:16:30.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德   他就像只大沙鼠\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler, it's like a big gerbil.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.86,0:16:35.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不害怕吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And that doesn't scare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.12,0:16:41.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯   需要帮忙吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, you need some help?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.29,0:16:43.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要帮我忙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}From you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.96,0:16:46.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的   拜托你了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.34,0:16:54.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,首先   犹他州\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}First of all, Utah?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.05,0:16:57.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟   你不能乱编州名\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dude, you can't just make stuff up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.06,0:17:06.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我恨美国\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I hate America.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.90,0:17:09.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,游戏结束后   我发誓我要搬家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When I finish this game, I swear I am moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.19,0:17:15.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿   泰格还在跟警察谈   对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Tag still talking to the police? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.36,0:17:17.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该死   我为什么要说话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ugh, damn it. Why did I open my mouth?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.16,0:17:20.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"我暗恋你   我被你吸引"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"I have a crush on you. I'm attracted to you."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.08,0:17:23.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道   我吓坏他了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know that I freaked him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.41,0:17:26.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你是那种口气  他一定吓坏了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If you said it like that, you probably did, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.33,0:17:29.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿   钱德在吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, is Chandler here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.75,0:17:32.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不在   他去散步了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, no, no, he went for a walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.34,0:17:34.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  你们不能告诉他啊   看看是谁回来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, well, you cannot tell him, but look who's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.51,0:17:39.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨   喔   不  不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. Oh, no, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.43,0:17:41.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他去罗斯家把小狗带回来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He went over to Ross' to bring the dog back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.10,0:17:44.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  小狗不在那里呀\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no, the dog's not going to be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.85,0:17:47.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你这么觉得啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.36,0:17:53.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨   甜心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.86,0:17:56.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,求求你  别对我生气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Please, please, please, don't be mad at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.91,0:17:58.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么   为什么   等着瞧吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Why would--? Shh. Wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.07,0:18:01.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我们会   或许我们不会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe we will, maybe we won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.49,0:18:06.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跑到罗斯家   想帮你把克朗克抱回来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I went over to Ross' apartment to bring back Klunkers, you know, for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.25,0:18:10.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我忘了关门   他一定是跑出去了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and, ahem, I left the door open, and she must've gotten out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.38,0:18:15.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我到处都找过了   找遍了整栋公寓   包括屋顶\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I looked everywhere, all over the apartment, including the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.84,0:18:19.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对了  罗斯  你邻居在屋顶上种大麻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Which, FYI, Ross, one of your neighbors, growing weed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.64,0:18:23.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我找不到他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I couldn't find him...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.31,0:18:27.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and I am so, so, so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.48,0:18:32.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我知道  怎么样能让大家忘记痛苦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I do know where we can all go ease the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.03,0:18:36.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有好消息   看看谁回来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We have good news. Look who's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.28,0:18:38.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.78,0:18:40.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,克朗克   我的天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Klunkers. Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.99,0:18:46.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错   他是自己跑回来的   这是感恩节的奇迹啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's right. She came back all by herself. It's a Thanksgiving miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.46,0:18:50.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真高兴能见到你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It is so good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.08,0:18:53.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他从罗斯家跑了回来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, she came all the way back from Ross' building.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.46,0:18:56.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他一定遇到了很多事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, the things she must've seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.92,0:18:58.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他爬上消防梯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Then she climbed up the fire escape...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.80,0:19:01.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,用他的小脚拍打窗户\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and she tapped on the window with her teeny little paw...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.59,0:19:03.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们跑去开窗让他进来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and we ran to let her in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.60,0:19:07.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说的太过火了   对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I went too far, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.18,0:19:10.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我该在哪里就住口呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When should I have stopped?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.28,0:19:20.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  或许这个游戏很难  是因为美国没有五十州\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, maybe this is so hard because there aren't 5O states.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.99,0:19:25.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得告诉你一件事  我写出四十九州的州名\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let me tell you something. I have 49 states.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.58,0:19:27.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很全的答案了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, there are no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.04,0:19:32.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我应该可以吃点东西了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, I think I should be able to eat something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.17,0:19:34.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,随便你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.97,0:19:41.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨   你还好吗   我很好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, hi. How are you doing? I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.09,0:19:45.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得到警局去  指认嫌犯的照片\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I gotta go down to the police station and look at mug shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.31,0:19:49.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你们邀请我来这里   秦格  你要走了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanks for having me over, you guys. Tag, you're going? Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.60,0:19:52.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们还没有机会好好谈一谈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We didn't, uh, get a chance to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.27,0:19:54.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说你是哪一州的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So where did you say you're from again?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.86,0:19:57.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,科罗拉多州   你真是没用\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Colorado. Ah, what good are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.62,0:20:07.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我想我们该谈谈   在阳台上发生的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, urn, I think we should talk about what happened on the terrace.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.70,0:20:09.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.25,0:20:11.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不该说那些话的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I never should've said what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.16,0:20:13.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的感觉并不重要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what? It just doesn't matter how I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.37,0:20:17.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们一起工作   不应该有任何私人关系\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We work together, so nothing could really ever happen between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.71,0:20:22.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,星期一我想高高兴兴去上班   再也不提这件事了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What I would love is just to go to work on Monday and never talk about this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.84,0:20:25.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  星期一是个大日子  我们还有很多事要做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay? Big day, Monday. Lots to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.97,0:20:28.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该还好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So we okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.51,0:20:30.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一点都不好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.89,0:20:34.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就知道   我吓到你了   不   你没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, God, I knew it. I freaked you out. No, you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.60,0:20:36.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吓坏我的反而是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The only thing that freaked me out was you saying...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.77,0:20:38.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说我们之间不该有关系\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...that nothing could happen between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.73,0:20:42.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗   对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.65,0:20:45.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请不要因为我这么做   就炒我鱿鱼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So please don't fire me for doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.96,0:20:58.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,星期一我们得做的事少了一件\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, well, that's one less thing we have to do on Monday.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.28,0:21:21.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,德拉瓦州\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Delaware.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.36,0:21:26.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,德拉瓦州\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Delaware.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.53,0:21:30.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧   我要吃我的火鸡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. I want my turkey now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.12,0:21:32.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.79,0:21:40.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你重覆写了两次内华达州\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You got Nevada twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.42,0:21:44.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道   好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know. Yeah.
